#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started with the Sampler backend primitive {#get-started-with-the-sampler-backend-primitive}"
msgstr "Magsimula sa Sampler backend primitive {#get-started-with-the-sampler-backend-primitive}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Sampler primitive can be run with any provider by using [`qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2). However, it requires a backend that supports the `memory` option.\n"
msgstr "Ang Sampler primitive ay maaaring patakbuhin sa anumang provider gamit ang [`qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2). Gayunpaman, nangangailangan ito ng backend na sumusuporta sa opsyon na `memory`.\n"

